    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d162">

                <pb facs="0271" n="173" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg173"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">813.00/992</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Jefferson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-08-20"><hi rendition="#italic">August 20,
                        1920</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received September 16.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 859</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of the Department’s No. 321 of June 25, 1920 requesting information as to the
                    exact present status with the Government of Nicaragua of the Treaties concluded
                    at the Central American Peace Conference of 1907 and known as the Conventions of
                    1907.</p>
                <p>For the information of the Department I have the honor to enclose herewith copy
                    of a Memorandum<anchor n="41" xml:id="d162-f1"/> requesting the information <pb
                        facs="0272" n="174" xml:id="pg174"/> desired by the Department which was
                    handed to the Sub-Secretary in charge of the Ministry for Foreign Affairs on
                    August 18th; and also copy and translation of a Memorandum of August 19th from
                    the Foreign Office in reply to the Legation’s Memorandum.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Benjamin L.
                    Jefferson</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d162-a1.xml" xpointer="d162-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
